      "playful",
      "irreverent",
      "punchy",
      "warm"
    ],
    "target_audience": "Adventurous home cooks, food-obsessed millennials and Gen Z consumers, hot sauce collectors, and spice-curious foodies who want flavor with their fire and a brand with genuine character."
  },
  "pages": [
    {
